{
 "about": "10CL016 PLL_1 counters (offline; xdev pll:M:D[:MODE], altpll from the 48 MHz pin E2). All PLL bits are in periphery logical frame 0, plane 1 (periph.py); no core bits change. Each counter is a hi field and a lo field (little-endian bit runs); count = hi + lo. M: flag byte 174 (set = C0 bypassed) + hi at 175..179, odd flag 183 + lo at 184..188. C0: hi 157..160, odd flag 165, lo 166..169 (bypassed when byte 174 is set: C0 = 1). N: hi 193..197, odd flag 201, lo 202..206, bypass flag 210 (set = N = 1). f_out = 48 MHz * M / (N * C0): reproduces all 45 builds (ratios 1/2 .. 20, N = 1..3, with and without compensation). Bytes 219..224 change with M/N (loop-filter / charge-pump settings, not decoded). observations_vs_pll_1_1 keeps the raw diffs.",
